{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1533371-w20-gurahl-with-bear-as-personal-totem","id":1533371,"title":"[W20] Gurahl with Bear as Personal Totem","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-03-29T22:06:12-07:00","id":1533371,"title":"[W20] Gurahl with Bear as Personal Totem","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> I am confused with the Gurahl sidebar, on <i>W20 Changing Breeds</i>:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FOLLOWING THE GREAT BEAR p.114</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">All Gurahl have Bear as their personal totem,<br /> but each Gurahl acknowledges one of Bear\u2019s three<br /> faces according to their auspice or temperament.</div> </div> </div> </div>Does this mean what the Gurahl:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Takes Bear as a Personal Totem for <i>free</i>, but with the listed benefits instead of those in the W20 Corebook p.374?</li> <li>Spend 5 Background dots on Bear as a Personal Totem, but with the listed benefits instead of those in the W20 Corebook p.374?</li> <li>Use a different option not mentioned here?</li> <li>If 1 is correct, can they ALSO buy the Totem Background for Bear? Do benefits stack?</li> </ol>Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 03-30-2024, 02:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-30T00:42:12-07:00","id":1533373,"title":"","content":"No, they have aspects of Bear that are distinct from the patron that Garou and other Fera take. The benefits are mentioned on page 114 of W20 Changing Breeds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-30T11:18:04-07:00","id":1533385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1533371-w20-gurahl-with-bear-as-personal-totem?p=1533373#post1533373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, they have aspects of Bear that are distinct from the patron that Garou and other Fera take. The benefits are mentioned on page 114 of W20 Changing Breeds.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for answering, but my question is separated in several options, so can you expand on it?<br /> <br /> Do I understand clearly, that you are picking option 3? They get some benefits that have nothing to do with the Totem Background ?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I ask because the text about totems in Changing Breeds mentions:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gurahl p.210</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Owing to their rarity, Gurahl rarely amass much<br /> in the way of Resources. All Gurahl have an <b>aspect of<br /> Bear as their personal Totem</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>But does this require the Totem Background or not?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> If not, can they ALSO buy the Totem Background for Bear? If they can, does it overlap with their benefits or replaces them? I think it is a replacement due to:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Totem p.212 and 213</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Owing perhaps to some similarity to the rites used by<br /> the hengeyokai, even Corax and<b> Gurahl are able to<br /> participate in the rite</b>, giving up Raven or <b>Bear\u2019s favor<br /> in exchange for that of the pack totem</b>\u200b\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> But it is not clear for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-30T11:30:47-07:00","id":1533387,"title":"","content":"Case 1: Typical Gurahl<br /> <br /> You have a bonus to Survival and two other Abilities. You do not have the benefits listed for Bear under the list of patrons in W20 or past W:tA core books.<br /> <br /> Case 2: Gurahl in a patron-bound group<br /> <br /> You do not have the bonus to Survival and two other Abilities as in Case 1. You have the benefits of the group's patron instead (which could be the Bear patron that Garou and non-Gurahl Fera take, and is likely the only case they get those specific benefits).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-30T11:44:16-07:00","id":1533389,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1533371-w20-gurahl-with-bear-as-personal-totem?p=1533387#post1533387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Case 1: Typical Gurahl<br /> <br /> You have a bonus to Survival and two other Abilities. You do not have the benefits listed for Bear under the list of patrons in W20 or past W:tA core books.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awesome, but does Case 1 obliges the Gurahl to buy the Totem Background, or if I am reading you right, it is intrinsic to being Gurahl?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1533371-w20-gurahl-with-bear-as-personal-totem?p=1533387#post1533387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Case 2: Gurahl in a patron-bound group<br /> <br /> You do not have the bonus to Survival and two other Abilities as in Case 1. You have the benefits of the group's patron instead (which could be the Bear patron that Garou and non-Gurahl Fera take, and is likely the only case they get those specific benefits).</div> </div> </div> </div>What if the Gurahl buys a personal totem (as in dots on the Totem Background), and this Totem is Bear itself? Overlap with or replace the benefits of Case 1?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 03-31-2024, 12:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-30T11:59:33-07:00","id":1533390,"title":"","content":"Intrinsic is how I've always run it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-30T13:18:10-07:00","id":1533392,"title":"","content":"If you buy a personal patron it would probably also replace Case 1.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-30T21:40:13-07:00","id":1533410,"title":"","content":"Thanks to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar23_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"23\" data-vbnamecard=\"23\">Saur Ops Specialist</a> and <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar479_1.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"479\" data-vbnamecard=\"479\">Damian May</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}